2026-07-27T12:26:31.8442295Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:26:31.8443399Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:26:31.8443999Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
